                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "the movement system is unclear to understand in first place and you don't have fun to find out how to improve your skills because you die within 5 seconds.\n\nyou start of reading through 10 pages of movment description.. without any 3D tutorial :( this is VR guys. use it !\nwhen you do your first jump you die almost immediately because you don't have enough time to figure out the controls until you splash onto the rocks\n\n\nthis game really needs a movement tutorial where you just fall / fly in a endless mode, where it SHOWS OFF a person next to you how to manouver, and you have to repeat the movements step by step.\n\nI really tried getting used to the controls by restarting over and over again. no success. no fun. just permanent rock splashing :(\n\n I can't recommend this game unless it gets a proper INTERACTIVE tutorial",
